, "mark": false, "pics": []}, "char": {"v": 1, "puppet": "", "voice": "", "voiceName": "", "script": "Ahhh, Scotland. It's been described as the place where heaven laid its beauty upon the earth. Those of us that call this place home often question, how did we get so fortunate? Is the rain really that bad? And, more recently, [angry] why are there so many fucking Somalians in my swimming pool? [calm] Glasgow, Scotland, has quietly become the refugee capital of the UK. Which is of course fantastic news, as there has been a noticeable gap in the Deliveroo economy, although it is somewhat sad to see qualified doctors and engineers forced to take these low paid jobs due to Scotland's institutional racism. Truly a stain on our country. But despite this being literally the greatest thing ever to happen to Scotland since Maradona's hand of God in 1986, would you believe that some so called native people aren't fully on board with it? Some locals, also known as Nazis, have been asking very far right questions, such as how will we pay for them, what about the current homeless problem in the city, and why are they all unaccompanied males? [calm] Listen, it makes me sick too. But, in the interest of science, I'm here to explain exactly why this is actually just fantastic, and absolutely no crime has increased. [angry] There's too many fucking refugees in Glasgow. [calm] Glasgow has always been a bit stabby. Or a lot stabby. I've always thought that if taking the bus was a city, it'd be Glasgow. So it's no stranger to violence, or drugs, or grown men using seagulls as weapons. What it is a stranger to, is diversity. In 2001, the white Scottish population of Glasgow was 87 percent. By 2022, it was 67 percent."}}, "assets": {}, "name": "Too Many Refugees (draft)", "note": "Hook, Setup and Point 1 laid out. Record the whole script as one take and Claude lines it up to your voice."}